# Send every non-preferred host to the single canonical domain, keeping the path.
# http → https on mehendibytrisha.in itself is handled by Netlify's "Force HTTPS"
# setting (no rule here, so the canonical host can never redirect to itself).
# Every rule below points to a different host, so redirect loops are impossible.
# The "!" forces the redirect even though the files exist on those hosts.
http://mehendi-by-trisha.netlify.app/*   https://mehendibytrisha.in/:splat  301!
https://mehendi-by-trisha.netlify.app/*  https://mehendibytrisha.in/:splat  301!
http://www.mehendibytrisha.in/*          https://mehendibytrisha.in/:splat  301!
https://www.mehendibytrisha.in/*         https://mehendibytrisha.in/:splat  301!
